        HelpPage(slug: "context-menus", title: "Context menus", group: "Basics", summary: "A context menu is the short menu that appears where you click, listing the commands that make sense for what is under the pointer.  WireTuner has them everywhere -- on objects, on empty pasteboard, on pages, and inside panels.",
