        HelpPage(slug: "copying-type", title: "Copying type attributes", group: "Type", summary: "When one piece of text looks right, you can give other text the same look without retyping every setting.  Copy Attributes and Paste Attributes carry a complete set of type settings from one selection to another; the Eyedropper tool does the same with one click.  Text styles are the durable version of this -- a named look you apply repeatedly and can change everywhere at once (Text styles).",
