        HelpPage(slug: "creating-opening", title: "Creating and opening documents", group: "Document setup", summary: "WireTuner documents live in your cloud library and are cached on every Mac you open them on.  A new document is created from a template, is yours the moment it exists, and is saved continuously: there is no Save command to remember, no unsaved changes to review on quit, and no file to lose. You can open as many documents as you like, in tabs or separate windows, and switch between them from the Window menu.",
