        HelpPage(slug: "cropping-bitmaps", title: "Cropping bitmap images", group: "Imported artwork", summary: "Cropping hides the parts of an image you do not want without throwing them away.  WireTuner offers two ways: the Crop tool, which trims an image to a rectangle and can be adjusted or undone at any time, and Paste Inside, which clips an image (or anything else) to any shape you draw.",
