        HelpPage(slug: "customizing", title: "Customizing your environment", group: "Basics", summary: "WireTuner lets you make the application yours: change any keyboard shortcut or switch to the shortcuts of another application, put the buttons you use on any toolbar, and save the arrangement of panels you like so you can come back to it.  Shortcut sets follow your account between Macs; toolbars and panel layouts stay with the Mac.",
